    group: "Users",
    title: "Skema Pengguna",
    sidebarTitle: "Skema Pengguna",
    description: "Definisi skema model data untuk user pada Anticeil",
    icon: "user",
    body: "## Gambaran Umum\n\nSkema objek `user` mendefinisikan atribut struktur data dan spesifikasi tipe objek Pengguna yang dikembalikan atau diproses oleh Anticeil Platform API.\n\n## Properti Objek\n\n| Properti | Tipe | Wajib | Keterangan / Nilai Enum |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `id` | `string` | Ya | \u2014 |\n| `email` | `string` | Ya | \u2014 |\n| `firstName` | `string` | Ya | \u2014 |\n| `status` | `enum` | Ya | Enum: `ACTIVE, INACTIVE` |\n| `externalId` | `string / null` | Tidak | \u2014 |\n| `platformId` | `string / null` | Tidak | \u2014 |\n| `platformRole` | `enum` | Ya | Enum: `ADMIN, MEMBER, OPERATOR` |\n| `lastName` | `string` | Ya | \u2014 |\n| `created` | `string` | Ya | \u2014 |\n| `updated` | `string` | Ya | \u2014 |\n| `lastActiveDate` | `string / null` | Tidak | \u2014 |\n| `imageUrl` | `string / null` | Tidak | \u2014 |\n\n## Contoh Representasi JSON\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"sample_id_123\",\n  \"email\": \"user@example.com\",\n  \"firstName\": \"Sample Firstname\",\n  \"status\": \"ACTIVE\",\n  \"externalId\": \"sample_externalId_123\",\n  \"platformId\": \"sample_platformId_123\",\n  \"platformRole\": \"ADMIN\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Sample Lastname\",\n  \"created\": \"2026-10-10T12:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"updated\": \"2026-10-10T12:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"lastActiveDate\": \"2026-10-10T12:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"imageUrl\": \"https://api.anticeil.com\"\n}\n```\n\n## Definisi Antarmuka TypeScript\n\n```typescript\nexport interface User {\n\n  id: string;\n\n  email: string;\n\n  firstName: string;\n\n  status: 'ACTIVE' | 'INACTIVE';\n\n  externalId?: string;\n\n  platformId?: string;\n\n  platformRole: 'ADMIN' | 'MEMBER' | 'OPERATOR';\n\n  lastName: string;\n\n  created: string;\n\n  updated: string;\n\n  lastActiveDate?: string;\n\n  imageUrl?: string;\n\n}\n```\n",
    toc: [{"id": "gambaran-umum", "title": "Gambaran Umum", "level": 2}, {"id": "properti-objek", "title": "Properti Objek", "level": 2}, {"id": "contoh-representasi-json", "title": "Contoh Representasi JSON", "level": 2}, {"id": "definisi-antarmuka-typescript", "title": "Definisi Antarmuka TypeScript", "level": 2}],
