  "endpoints/flows/schema": {
    slug: "endpoints/flows/schema",
    tab: "API Reference",
    group: "Flows",
    title: "Skema Alur Kerja",
    sidebarTitle: "Skema Alur Kerja",
    description: "Definisi skema model data untuk flow pada Anticeil",
    icon: "cube",
    body: "## Gambaran Umum\n\nSkema objek `flow` mendefinisikan atribut struktur data dan spesifikasi tipe objek Alur Kerja (Flows) yang dikembalikan atau diproses oleh Anticeil Platform API.\n\n## Properti Objek\n\n| Properti | Tipe | Wajib | Keterangan / Nilai Enum |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `id` | `string` | Ya | \u2014 |\n| `created` | `string` | Ya | \u2014 |\n| `updated` | `string` | Ya | \u2014 |\n| `projectId` | `string` | Ya | \u2014 |\n| `externalId` | `string` | Ya | \u2014 |\n| `ownerId` | `string / null` | Tidak | \u2014 |\n| `folderId` | `string / null` | Tidak | \u2014 |\n| `status` | `enum` | Ya | Enum: `ENABLED, DISABLED` |\n| `publishedVersionId` | `string / null` | Tidak | \u2014 |\n| `metadata` | `object / null` | Tidak | \u2014 |\n| `operationStatus` | `enum` | Ya | Enum: `NONE, DELETING, ENABLING, DISABLING` |\n| `timeSavedPerRun` | `number / null` | Tidak | \u2014 |\n| `templateId` | `string / null` | Tidak | \u2014 |\n\n## Contoh Representasi JSON\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"sample_id_123\",\n  \"created\": \"2026-10-10T12:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"updated\": \"2026-10-10T12:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"projectId\": \"sample_projectId_123\",\n  \"externalId\": \"sample_externalId_123\",\n  \"ownerId\": \"sample_ownerId_123\",\n  \"folderId\": \"sample_folderId_123\",\n  \"status\": \"ENABLED\",\n  \"publishedVersionId\": \"sample_publishedVersionId_123\",\n  \"metadata\": \"sample_value\",\n  \"operationStatus\": \"NONE\",\n  \"timeSavedPerRun\": \"2026-10-10T12:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"templateId\": \"sample_templateId_123\"\n}\n```\n\n## Definisi Antarmuka TypeScript\n\n```typescript\nexport interface Flow {\n\n  id: string;\n\n  created: string;\n\n  updated: string;\n\n  projectId: string;\n\n  externalId: string;\n\n  ownerId?: string;\n\n  folderId?: string;\n\n  status: 'ENABLED' | 'DISABLED';\n\n  publishedVersionId?: string;\n\n  metadata?: any;\n\n  operationStatus: 'NONE' | 'DELETING' | 'ENABLING' | 'DISABLING';\n\n  timeSavedPerRun?: any;\n\n  templateId?: string;\n\n}\n```\n",
    toc: [{"id": "gambaran-umum", "title": "Gambaran Umum", "level": 2}, {"id": "properti-objek", "title": "Properti Objek", "level": 2}, {"id": "contoh-representasi-json", "title": "Contoh Representasi JSON", "level": 2}, {"id": "definisi-antarmuka-typescript", "title": "Definisi Antarmuka TypeScript", "level": 2}],
  },
  "endpoints/flows/create": {
    slug: "endpoints/flows/create",
    tab: "API Reference",
    group: "Flows",
    title: "Buat Alur Kerja",
    sidebarTitle: "Buat Alur Kerja",
    description: "Endpoint Buat Alur Kerja untuk Alur Kerja (Flows) pada Anticeil Platform API",
    icon: "",
    body: "```http\nPOST /v1/flows\n```\n\n## Gambaran Umum\n\nEndpoint **Buat Alur Kerja** (`POST /v1/flows`) memungkinkan Anda untuk mengelola sumber daya Alur Kerja (Flows) secara terprogram pada Anticeil Platform API.\n\n## Autentikasi\n\nSertakan Kunci API Anda di header permintaan `Authorization` menggunakan skema Bearer:\n\n```bash\nAuthorization: Bearer <KUNCI_API_ANDA>\n```\n\n## Isi Permintaan (Request Body)\n\n| Field | Tipe | Wajib | Deskripsi |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `displayName` | `string` | Ya | \u2014 |\n| `folderId` | `string` | Tidak | \u2014 |\n| `folderName` | `string` | Tidak | \u2014 |\n| `projectId` | `string` | Ya | \u2014 |\n| `templateId` | `string` | Tidak | \u2014 |\n| `metadata` | `object` | Tidak | \u2014 |\n\n### Contoh Payload JSON\n\n```json\n{\n  \"displayName\": \"Sample Displayname\",\n  \"folderId\": \"sample_folderId_123\",\n  \"folderName\": \"Sample Foldername\",\n  \"projectId\": \"sample_projectId_123\",\n  \"templateId\": \"sample_templateId_123\",\n  \"metadata\": {}\n}\n```\n\n## Respons\n\n### Status `201` - Berhasil Dibuat\n\n### Contoh Format Respons\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"sample_id_123\",\n  \"created\": \"2026-10-10T12:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"updated\": \"2026-10-10T12:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"projectId\": \"sample_projectId_123\",\n  \"externalId\": \"sample_externalId_123\",\n  \"ownerId\": \"sample_ownerId_123\"\n}\n```\n\n## Contoh Kode\n\n### cURL\n\n```bash\ncurl -X POST \"https://api.anticeil.com/v1/flows\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $ANTICEIL_API_KEY\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n      \"displayName\": \"Sample Displayname\",\n      \"folderId\": \"sample_folderId_123\",\n      \"folderName\": \"Sample Foldername\"\n    }'\n```\n\n### JavaScript (Fetch)\n\n```javascript\nconst response = await fetch('https://api.anticeil.com/v1/flows', {\n  method: 'POST',\n  headers: {\n    'Authorization': `Bearer ${process.env.ANTICEIL_API_KEY}`,\n    'Content-Type': 'application/json',\n  },\n  body: JSON.stringify({\n        \"displayName\": \"Sample Displayname\",\n        \"folderId\": \"sample_folderId_123\",\n        \"folderName\": \"Sample Foldername\"\n  }),\n});\nconst data = await response.json();\nconsole.log(data);\n```\n",
    toc: [{"id": "gambaran-umum", "title": "Gambaran Umum", "level": 2}, {"id": "autentikasi", "title": "Autentikasi", "level": 2}, {"id": "isi-permintaan-request-body", "title": "Isi Permintaan (Request Body)", "level": 2}, {"id": "contoh-payload-json", "title": "Contoh Payload JSON", "level": 3}, {"id": "respons", "title": "Respons", "level": 2}, {"id": "status-201---berhasil-dibuat", "title": "Status 201 - Berhasil Dibuat", "level": 3}, {"id": "contoh-format-respons", "title": "Contoh Format Respons", "level": 3}, {"id": "contoh-kode", "title": "Contoh Kode", "level": 2}, {"id": "curl", "title": "cURL", "level": 3}, {"id": "javascript-fetch", "title": "JavaScript (Fetch)", "level": 3}],
  },
