    icon: "",
    body: "```http\nGET /v1/flow-runs/{id}\n```\n\n## Gambaran Umum\n\nEndpoint **Ambil Data Eksekusi Alur** (`GET /v1/flow-runs/{id}`) memungkinkan Anda untuk mengelola sumber daya Riwayat Eksekusi (Flow Runs) secara terprogram pada Anticeil Platform API.\n\n## Autentikasi\n\nSertakan Kunci API Anda di header permintaan `Authorization` menggunakan skema Bearer:\n\n```bash\nAuthorization: Bearer <KUNCI_API_ANDA>\n```\n\n## Parameter Permintaan\n\n| Parameter | Tipe | Lokasi | Wajib | Deskripsi |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `id` | `string` | `path` | Ya | \u2014 |\n\n## Respons\n\n### Status `200` - Berhasil\n\nMengembalikan objek data yang sesuai dengan skema [`flow-run`](/docs/endpoints/flow-runs/schema).\n\n### Contoh Format Respons\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"sample_id_123\",\n  \"created\": \"2026-10-10T12:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"updated\": \"2026-10-10T12:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"projectId\": \"sample_projectId_123\",\n  \"flowId\": \"sample_flowId_123\",\n  \"parentRunId\": \"sample_parentRunId_123\"\n}\n```\n\n## Contoh Kode\n\n### cURL\n\n```bash\ncurl -X GET \"https://api.anticeil.com/v1/flow-runs/{id}\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $ANTICEIL_API_KEY\"\n```\n\n### JavaScript (Fetch)\n\n```javascript\nconst response = await fetch('https://api.anticeil.com/v1/flow-runs/{id}', {\n  method: 'GET',\n  headers: {\n    'Authorization': `Bearer ${process.env.ANTICEIL_API_KEY}`,\n  },\n});\nconst data = await response.json();\nconsole.log(data);\n```\n",
