    description: "Definisi skema model data untuk git-repo pada Anticeil",
    icon: "cube",
    body: "## Gambaran Umum\n\nSkema objek `git-repo` mendefinisikan atribut struktur data dan spesifikasi tipe objek Repositori Git yang dikembalikan atau diproses oleh Anticeil Platform API.\n\n## Properti Objek\n\n| Properti | Tipe | Wajib | Keterangan / Nilai Enum |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `id` | `string` | Ya | \u2014 |\n| `created` | `string` | Ya | \u2014 |\n| `updated` | `string` | Ya | \u2014 |\n| `remoteUrl` | `string` | Ya | \u2014 |\n| `branch` | `string` | Ya | \u2014 |\n| `branchType` | `enum` | Ya | Enum: `PRODUCTION, DEVELOPMENT` |\n| `projectId` | `string` | Ya | \u2014 |\n| `slug` | `string` | Ya | \u2014 |\n\n## Contoh Representasi JSON\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"sample_id_123\",\n  \"created\": \"2026-10-10T12:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"updated\": \"2026-10-10T12:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"remoteUrl\": \"https://api.anticeil.com\",\n  \"branch\": \"sample_branch\",\n  \"branchType\": \"PRODUCTION\",\n  \"projectId\": \"sample_projectId_123\",\n  \"slug\": \"sample_slug\"\n}\n```\n\n## Definisi Antarmuka TypeScript\n\n```typescript\nexport interface GitRepo {\n\n  id: string;\n\n  created: string;\n\n  updated: string;\n\n  remoteUrl: string;\n\n  branch: string;\n\n  branchType: 'PRODUCTION' | 'DEVELOPMENT';\n\n  projectId: string;\n\n  slug: string;\n\n}\n```\n",
    toc: [{"id": "gambaran-umum", "title": "Gambaran Umum", "level": 2}, {"id": "properti-objek", "title": "Properti Objek", "level": 2}, {"id": "contoh-representasi-json", "title": "Contoh Representasi JSON", "level": 2}, {"id": "definisi-antarmuka-typescript", "title": "Definisi Antarmuka TypeScript", "level": 2}],
