  "handbook/engineering/playbooks/ai-engineering-guide": {
    slug: "handbook/engineering/playbooks/ai-engineering-guide",
    tab: "General",
    group: "Docs",
    title: "AI Engineering Guide",
    sidebarTitle: "AI Engineering Guide",
    description: "",
    icon: "wand-magic-sparkles",
    body: "## Panduan Rekayasa AI\n\nPanduan terbaik untuk membangun dan mengintegrasikan agen AI, model kontekstual, dan ekosistem MCP di Anticeil.\n\n### Praktik Terbaik Rekayasa Prompt\n\n- Berikan instruksi yang jelas, terstruktur, dan berbasis peran (role-based).\n- Gunakan batasan negatif secara tegas untuk mencegah halusinasi.\n- Selalu sediakan contoh format keluaran (few-shot prompting) dalam JSON terstruktur.\n\n### Integrasi Alat (Tools)\n\nSetiap aksi yang disediakan untuk model AI harus memiliki deskripsi parameter yang jelas dan validasi skema yang ketat.",
    toc: [{"id": "what-we-built", "title": "What We Built", "level": 2}, {"id": "the-workflow-prompt-to-feature-to-ship", "title": "The Workflow: Prompt to Feature to Ship", "level": 2}, {"id": "1-write-a-clear-brief-5-min", "title": "1. Write a Clear Brief (5 min)", "level": 3}, {"id": "2-explore-plan-mode--15-min", "title": "2. Explore (Plan Mode) \u2014 15 min", "level": 3}, {"id": "3-implement--30-90-min", "title": "3. Implement \u2014 30-90 min", "level": 3}, {"id": "4-test--10-30-min", "title": "4. Test \u2014 10-30 min", "level": 3}, {"id": "5-verify-and-ship--10-min", "title": "5. Verify and Ship \u2014 10 min", "level": 3}, {"id": "parallel-features-2-3-at-once", "title": "Parallel Features (2-3 at Once)", "level": 2}, {"id": "session-management", "title": "Session Management", "level": 2}, {"id": "code-review-checklist-for-ai-generated-code", "title": "Code Review Checklist (for AI-Generated Code)", "level": 2}, {"id": "weekly-rhythm-5-featuresweek-target", "title": "Weekly Rhythm (5 Features/Week Target)", "level": 2}, {"id": "tips-from-top-performers", "title": "Tips from Top Performers", "level": 2}, {"id": "quick-reference", "title": "Quick Reference", "level": 2}, {"id": "onboarding-first-week", "title": "Onboarding (First Week)", "level": 2}],
  },
  "handbook/engineering/playbooks/building-for-self-hosting": {
    slug: "handbook/engineering/playbooks/building-for-self-hosting",
    tab: "General",
    group: "Docs",
    title: "Membangun untuk Self-Hosting",
    sidebarTitle: "Membangun Self-Hosting",
    description: "Praktik terbaik arsitektur sistem agar selalu optimal dijalankan secara self-hosted",
    icon: "server",
    body: "Saat membangun fitur baru di Anticeil, pastikan fitur tersebut dapat berjalan dengan lancar baik di cloud terkelola maupun pada instalasi Docker Compose mandiri di server pelanggan.\n\n## Pertimbangan Self-Hosting\n\n- **Tanpa Ketergantungan Eksternal Wajib:** Jangan menambahkan dependensi layanan cloud berbayar wajib yang tidak dapat digantikan di lingkungan lokal.\n- **Variabel Lingkungan Sederhana:** Berikan nilai default yang masuk akal untuk setiap variabel konfigurasi lingkungan baru.\n- **Migrasi Database Aman:** Pastikan script migrasi TypeORM dapat berjalan tanpa jeda waktu mati (zero-downtime).\n",
    toc: [{"id": "the-core-rule-default-to-zero-setup", "title": "The core rule: default to zero-setup", "level": 2}, {"id": "failure-modes-we-keep-hitting", "title": "Failure modes we keep hitting", "level": 2}, {"id": "if-it-genuinely-cant-be-zero-setup", "title": "If it genuinely can't be zero-setup", "level": 2}],
  },
  "handbook/engineering/playbooks/canary-deployment": {
    slug: "handbook/engineering/playbooks/canary-deployment",
    tab: "General",
    group: "Docs",
    title: "Canary Deployment",
    sidebarTitle: "Canary Deployment",
    description: "",
    icon: "bird",
    body: "## Deployment Canary\n\nStrategi deployment canary memungkinkan kita menguji versi baru pada sebagian kecil pengguna sebelum merilisnya ke seluruh armada produksi.\n\n### Alur Deployment\n\n1. Rilis image container baru dengan tag `:canary`.\n2. Alihkan 5% lalu lintas HTTP dan pekerja alur kerja ke armada canary.\n3. Pantau metrik error rate, latensi, dan pemakaian memori selama 30 menit.\n4. Jika metrik normal, lanjutkan peluncuran penuh ke 100% pengguna.",
    toc: [{"id": "architecture-overview", "title": "Architecture Overview", "level": 2}, {"id": "canary-membership-db-backed-with-redis-cache", "title": "Canary membership: DB-backed with Redis cache", "level": 2}, {"id": "components", "title": "Components", "level": 2}, {"id": "canary-app", "title": "Canary App", "level": 3}, {"id": "canary-workers", "title": "Canary Workers", "level": 3}, {"id": "primary-app-config", "title": "Primary App Config", "level": 3}, {"id": "websocket--real-time-updates", "title": "WebSocket / Real-time Updates", "level": 2}, {"id": "queue-isolation", "title": "Queue Isolation", "level": 2}, {"id": "deploying-a-new-canary-build", "title": "Deploying a New Canary Build", "level": 2}, {"id": "rolling-back-a-canary-deployment", "title": "Rolling Back a Canary Deployment", "level": 2}, {"id": "promoting-canary-build-to-production", "title": "Promoting canary build to production", "level": 2}, {"id": "managing-platform-routing", "title": "Managing Platform Routing", "level": 2}, {"id": "enable-canary-routing-for-a-platform", "title": "Enable canary routing for a platform", "level": 3}, {"id": "disable-canary-routing-for-a-platform", "title": "Disable canary routing for a platform", "level": 3}],
  },
  "handbook/engineering/playbooks/connect-claude-to-chrome": {
    slug: "handbook/engineering/playbooks/connect-claude-to-chrome",
    tab: "General",
    group: "Docs",
    title: "Connect Claude to Chrome",
    sidebarTitle: "Connect Claude to Chrome",
    description: "",
    icon: "link",
    body: "## Menghubungkan Claude ke Chrome DevTools\n\nPanduan untuk menghubungkan agen AI Claude Code dengan Chrome DevTools MCP server untuk inspeksi dan pengujian antarmuka otomatis.\n\n### Konfigurasi\n\n1. Pastikan browser Chrome dijalankan dengan port debugging terbuka:\n```bash\nchrome.exe --remote-debugging-port=9222\n```\n2. Konfigurasikan MCP server pada berkas pengaturan Claude Code:\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"chrome-devtools\": {\n      \"command\": \"npx\",\n      \"args\": [\"-y\", \"chrome-devtools-mcp@latest\", \"--port=9222\"]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n3. Uji koneksi dengan menjalankan pemeriksaan halaman otomatis.",
    toc: [{"id": "linux", "title": "Linux", "level": 2}, {"id": "1-start-chrome-with-remote-debugging", "title": "1. Start Chrome with remote debugging", "level": 3}, {"id": "2-install-claude-code", "title": "2. Install Claude Code", "level": 3}, {"id": "3-add-the-chrome-devtools-mcp", "title": "3. Add the Chrome DevTools MCP", "level": 3}, {"id": "windows--wsl", "title": "Windows + WSL", "level": 2}, {"id": "1-configure-wsl-mirrored-networking", "title": "1. Configure WSL mirrored networking", "level": 3}, {"id": "2-install-claude-code-and-add-the-mcp-inside-wsl", "title": "2. Install Claude Code and add the MCP (inside WSL)", "level": 3}, {"id": "3-start-chrome-on-windows", "title": "3. Start Chrome on Windows", "level": 3}, {"id": "verify-the-connection", "title": "Verify the connection", "level": 2}, {"id": "1-check-the-debug-endpoint", "title": "1. Check the debug endpoint", "level": 3}, {"id": "2-check-the-mcp-connection-in-claude-code", "title": "2. Check the MCP connection in Claude Code", "level": 3}, {"id": "devcontainer", "title": "Devcontainer", "level": 2}],
  },
