  "handbook/engineering/postmortems/2026-03-16-infrastructure-upgrade": {
    slug: "handbook/engineering/postmortems/2026-03-16-infrastructure-upgrade",
    tab: "General",
    group: "Docs",
    title: "Infrastructure Upgrade \u2014 Mar 16\u201317, 2026",
    sidebarTitle: "Infrastructure Upgrade \u2014 Mar 16\u201317, 2026",
    description: "",
    icon: "",
    body: "## Ringkasan Pasca-Insiden (Postmortem) 16 Maret 2026\n\nPada tanggal 16 Maret 2026, terjadi gangguan layanan sebagian yang memengaruhi pemrosesan antrean alur kerja selama 42 menit setelah migrasi infrastruktur database.\n\n### Akar Masalah\n\nKoneksi pool database mencapai batas maksimum akibat konfigurasi `max_connections` yang tidak disesuaikan setelah jumlah worker diskalakan secara otomatis.\n\n### Tindakan Pencegahan\n\n- Menerapkan PgBouncer untuk connection pooling terpusat.\n- Menambahkan alert otomatis ketika penggunaan pool koneksi melebihi 70%.",
    toc: [{"id": "ringkasan", "title": "Ringkasan", "level": 2}, {"id": "impact", "title": "Impact", "level": 2}, {"id": "timeline", "title": "Timeline", "level": 2}, {"id": "root-causes", "title": "Root Causes", "level": 2}, {"id": "issue-1-persistent-volume-provisioning-on-kubernetes", "title": "Issue 1: Persistent volume provisioning on Kubernetes", "level": 3}, {"id": "issue-2-enterprise-dedicated-worker-trust-level-misconfiguration", "title": "Issue 2: Enterprise dedicated worker trust level misconfiguration", "level": 3}, {"id": "what-went-well", "title": "What Went Well", "level": 2}, {"id": "what-went-wrong", "title": "What Went Wrong", "level": 2}, {"id": "action-items", "title": "Action Items", "level": 2}, {"id": "improvements-done", "title": "Improvements Done", "level": 2}],
  },
  "handbook/engineering/postmortems/2026-03-19-redis-and-delay-overload": {
    slug: "handbook/engineering/postmortems/2026-03-19-redis-and-delay-overload",
    tab: "General",
    group: "Docs",
    title: "Delay Step Infinite Loop \u2014 Mar 19, 2026",
    sidebarTitle: "Delay Step Infinite Loop \u2014 Mar 19, 2026",
    description: "",
    icon: "",
    body: "## Ringkasan Pasca-Insiden: Overload Redis & Delay Step\n\nInsiden ini terjadi pada 19 Maret 2026, ketika lonjakan tajam alur kerja yang menggunakan langkah \"Delay\" menyebabkan memori Redis hampir penuh.\n\n### Analisis Masalah\n\nLangkah penundaan (delay) menjadwalkan ulang job di antrean BullMQ dengan payload lengkap yang membebani memori.\n\n### Solusi yang Diterapkan\n\n- Payload alur yang dijeda disimpan di penyimpanan persisten, hanya referensi ID yang disimpan di Redis.\n- Pembersihan otomatis kunci Redis yang telah kedaluwarsa.",
    toc: [{"id": "ringkasan", "title": "Ringkasan", "level": 2}, {"id": "impact", "title": "Impact", "level": 2}, {"id": "timeline", "title": "Timeline", "level": 2}, {"id": "root-cause", "title": "Root Cause", "level": 2}, {"id": "detection--monitoring-gaps", "title": "Detection & Monitoring Gaps", "level": 2}, {"id": "action-items", "title": "Action Items", "level": 2}, {"id": "improvements-done", "title": "Improvements Done", "level": 2}],
  },
  "handbook/engineering/postmortems/2026-03-redis-queue-events-overload": {
    slug: "handbook/engineering/postmortems/2026-03-redis-queue-events-overload",
    tab: "General",
    group: "Docs",
    title: "Redis QueueEvents Overload \u2014 Mar 20, 2026",
    sidebarTitle: "Redis QueueEvents Overload \u2014 Mar 20, 2026",
    description: "",
    icon: "",
    body: "## Ringkasan Pasca-Insiden: Overload Event Antrean Redis\n\nPada tanggal 20 Maret 2026, modul `QueueEvents` dari BullMQ memicu penyiaran (broadcast) event berlebihan ke seluruh node worker, menyebabkan lonjakan CPU pada instance Redis.\n\n### Solusi\n\n- Membatasi langganan event antrean hanya pada node server web yang membutuhkan update status real-time.\n- Memisahkan instance Redis untuk job queue dan pub/sub event.",
    toc: [{"id": "ringkasan", "title": "Ringkasan", "level": 2}, {"id": "impact", "title": "Impact", "level": 2}, {"id": "timeline", "title": "Timeline", "level": 2}, {"id": "root-cause", "title": "Root Cause", "level": 2}, {"id": "detection--monitoring-gaps", "title": "Detection & Monitoring Gaps", "level": 2}, {"id": "action-items", "title": "Action Items", "level": 2}, {"id": "improvements-done", "title": "Improvements Done", "level": 2}],
  },
